{"schemaVersion":2,"id":"meetdeet-2010-common-biology-05","exam":"MEET_DEET","year":2010,"subject":"biology","number":5,"points":2,"unitId":"bio-methods","unitLabel":"생명과학 실험·분석","topic":"현미경","classificationStatus":"keyword-candidate-unverified","classificationCandidates":["bio-methods","micro"],"stem":"그림은 세균을 염색하여 광학현미경으로 관찰하는 과정을 나타낸 \n것이다.\n이에 대한 설명으로 옳은 것만을 <보기>에서 있는 대로 고른 것은?\n<보 기>\nㄱ. (가)에서 세균의 단백질은 열에 의해 변성되어 슬라이드 표면에 \n고정된다.\nㄴ. (나)의 메틸렌블루는 세포 안의 양전하를 띠는 단백질을 염색\n한다.\nㄷ. (다)에서 해상도를 높이기 위해 오일(immersion oil)을 사용\n한다.\nㄹ. 현미경의 해상도는 청색 가시광선보다 적색 가시광선을 사용\n하면 더 높다.","stemTextItemIds":["t001","t002","t003","t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"stemAssetIds":["fig-01","fig-02","fig-03"],"options":[{"number":1,"text":"ㄱ, ㄴ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t013"]},{"number":2,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t014"]},{"number":3,"text":"ㄴ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t015"]},{"number":4,"text":"ㄱ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t016"]},{"number":5,"text":"ㄴ, ㄷ, ㄹ","assetIds":[],"textItemIds":["t017"]}],"answer":null,"acceptedAnswers":[],"answerStatus":"untranscribed","assets":[{"id":"fig-01","width":357,"height":27,"region":0,"bbox":[162.3,50.903,142.8,10.8],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-05/01.webp"},{"id":"fig-02","width":761,"height":190,"region":0,"bbox":[17.5,69.303,304.4,76.0],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":[],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-05/02.webp"},{"id":"fig-03","width":774,"height":408,"region":0,"bbox":[14.3,194.903,309.6,163.2],"role":"stem","overlayTextItemIds":["t004","t005","t006","t007","t008","t009","t010","t011","t012"],"src":"/mdeet/assets/meetdeet-2010-common-biology-05/03.webp"}],"layout":[{"page":4,"sourceRect":[82.9,152.297,417.0,562.522],"width":334.1,"height":410.225,"items":[{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-01","bbox":[162.3,50.903,142.8,10.8],"section":"stem"},{"type":"image","assetId":"fig-02","bbox":[17.5,69.303